  ],
  "tts": [
    {"text": "拍卖场不是另一个地方。", "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts", "context": "男主陆野内心旁白，低沉，进入新空间的震撼。", "output": "audio/inner-01.mp3", "speech_rate": 5},
    {"text": "它就藏在现实下面。", "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts", "context": "男主陆野内心旁白，冷静解释。", "output": "audio/inner-02.mp3", "speech_rate": 5},
    {"text": "只要规则点头，整座城都会变成它的桌面。", "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts", "context": "男主陆野内心旁白，压迫、电影感。", "output": "audio/inner-03.mp3", "speech_rate": 4},
    {"text": "这是什么地方？", "speaker": "ICL_uranus_zh_female_xingganmeihuo_tob", "context": "宁晚压低声音，警惕、震惊。", "output": "audio/ning-01.mp3", "speech_rate": 4},
    {"text": "规则的后台。", "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts", "context": "陆野低声回答，短、稳。", "output": "audio/lu-01.mp3", "speech_rate": 0},
    {"text": "上一世没人活着走到这里。", "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts", "context": "男主陆野内心旁白，沉重。", "output": "audio/inner-04.mp3", "speech_rate": 4},
    {"text": "准入者，陆野。", "speaker": "ICL_uranus_zh_female_xingganmeihuo_tob", "context": "机械广播女声，冷淡宣告。", "output": "audio/broadcast-01.mp3", "speech_rate": -2},
    {"text": "携带未登记同行者一名。", "speaker": "ICL_uranus_zh_female_xingganmeihuo_tob", "context": "机械广播女声，危险地读出宁晚。", "output": "audio/broadcast-02.mp3", "speech_rate": -2},
    {"text": "它在数人。", "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts", "context": "男主陆野内心旁白，短促。", "output": "audio/inner-05.mp3", "speech_rate": 4},
    {"text": "也在数价。", "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts", "context": "男主陆野内心旁白，压低收紧。", "output": "audio/inner-06.mp3", "speech_rate": 4},
    {"text": "下一轮拍卖，开始。", "speaker": "ICL_uranus_zh_female_xingganmeihuo_tob", "context": "机械广播女声，庄严开启。", "output": "audio/broadcast-03.mp3", "speech_rate": -2},
    {"text": "我看见门后站着很多人。", "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts", "context": "男主陆野内心旁白，压迫感。", "output": "audio/inner-07.mp3", "speech_rate": 4},
    {"text": "每个人头顶，都有一个价格。", "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts", "context": "男主陆野内心旁白，结尾钩子。", "output": "audio/inner-08.mp3", "speech_rate": 3}
  ],
